<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>卷三射集 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 08:30:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>摩治法：论手足疼痛 论脏腑癥结 论颈项强直 论口眼歪斜</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-7-mozhifa/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 08:29:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-7-mozhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“摩治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;手足疼痛、脏腑癥结、颈项强直、口眼歪斜&lt;/strong&gt;四种病症的按摩外治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;以手法抚摩捶摇，流通气血，舒筋活络，使痰瘀自散、风邪自去&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>瘦治法：论瘦人多火</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-6-shouzhifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 18:29:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-6-shouzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“瘦治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;瘦人多火&lt;/strong&gt;的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;瘦人多火，火之有余，实乃水之不足。治当峻补真阴以镇阳光，不可徒恃苦寒折火&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>肥治法：论气虚多痰</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-5-feizhifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 09:22:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-5-feizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“肥治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;肥人气虚多痰&lt;/strong&gt;的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;肥人多痰，其本在气虚，而气虚之根又在命门心包之火不足。故治痰不可仅治痰，当补气兼补肾火，火足土旺，气充痰消&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>缚治法：论肺痈开刀 论欠伸两手不能下</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-4-fuzhifa/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 17:18:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-4-fuzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“缚治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;肺痈开刀排脓&lt;/strong&gt;与&lt;strong&gt;欠伸两手不能下&lt;/strong&gt;两种须借助束缚固定以施治的特殊治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;以绳缚定其身，趁其不备或情急之际，施以刀刺或令其自展，以达排脓、复位之效&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>倒治法：论肝叶倒转 论狂言见鬼 论堕水淹死</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-3-daozhifa/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 10:45:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-3-daozhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“倒治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;肝叶倒转、痰结狂言、堕水淹死&lt;/strong&gt;等特殊病症的反常治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;不可顺治，因而倒转治之&lt;/strong&gt;。通过颠倒体位、探吐顽痰、倒水急救等非常手段，使逆乱之气机复位，闭阻之窍道开通。</description></item><item><title>霸治法：论大渴 大吐 大泻 大满 发背痈肿</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-2-bazhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 13:25:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-2-bazhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“霸治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;大吐、大泻、大满、大渴、发背痈肿&lt;/strong&gt;等危重急症的峻猛治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病至危殆，死亡顷刻，不可用王道缓图，必以大剂攻邪逐毒之药，单刀直进，摧荡扫除&lt;/strong&gt;，方能力挽狂澜。</description></item><item><title>王治法：论饮食难消 内伤诸症</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-1-wangzhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 08:20:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-1-wangzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“王治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;病后体虚、饮食难消、内伤杂症&lt;/strong&gt;的缓调法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;王道荡荡，平补缓调&lt;/strong&gt;。对于大病初愈或内伤虚损之证，不可用霸道峻剂，当以六君子汤为基础，随症加减，徐徐图功。</description></item></channel></rss>